<view class="page paper-page dashboard-page theme-diary">
  <view class="page-head paper-title dashboard-title-board title-pattern-card floral-title-card">
    <image class="title-pattern-image" src="/assets/title-patterns/dark-green.png" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="title-pattern-mask"></view>
    <view class="corner-ornament corner-ornament-left corner-ornament--green"></view>
    <view class="corner-ornament corner-ornament-right corner-ornament--gold"></view>
    <view class="paper-corner bottom-left"></view>
    <view class="paper-corner bottom-right"></view>
    <view class="title-content">
      <text class="paper-title__stamp">趋势不是审判</text>
      <text class="hero-title">吗喽复盘台</text>
      <text class="subtext">它不会替你决定要不要离职，只帮你看见哪些事正在反复消耗你。</text>
      <view class="paper-title__rail"><view class="paper-title__rail-line"></view><view class="paper-title__rail-dot"></view><view class="paper-title__rail-dot"></view><view class="paper-title__rail-line"></view></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <character-card image="{{companion.image}}" name="{{companion.name}}" tag="{{companion.tag}}" message="{{companion.message}}" sub-message="{{companion.subMessage}}" variant="{{companion.variant}}" size="{{companion.size}}" />

  <view class="filter-panel range-tags"><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{activeRange === item.key ? 'pink' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="switchRange">{{item.label}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!hasRecords}}" class="empty-card trend-empty"><text>还没有足够记录生成趋势。</text><text>先写下一条真实的日记就好。</text></view>

  <block wx:if="{{hasRecords}}">
    <view class="ornament-card ornament-card--green advice-card"><view class="corner-ornament corner-ornament-left corner-ornament--green"></view><text class="section-title">当前照顾提示</text><view class="amulet-note"><text class="advice">{{stats.advice}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="stats-grid"><view class="stat-card"><text class="num">{{stats.total}}</text><text>真实记录次数</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="num">{{stats.averageImpact}}</text><text>平均事件等级</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="num">{{stats.highImpactCount}}</text><text>4–5 级事件</text></view><view class="stat-card"><text class="num">{{stats.reasonTypes}}</text><text>出现的问题类型</text></view></view>
    <view class="ornament-card pattern-card"><text class="section-title">最常出现</text><text class="pattern-reason">{{stats.topReason}}</text><text class="body-text muted">这一段记录里出现 {{stats.topReasonCount}} 次。</text></view>
    <view class="ornament-card"><text class="section-title">与前一段比</text><view wx:for="{{trendNotes}}" wx:key="*this" class="fact-row"><text class="fact-dot">•</text><text>{{item}}</text></view><text class="method-note">这里只比较记录数量、等级和分类，不判断你的情况好坏。</text></view>
    <view class="ornament-card"><text class="section-title">最近反复出现</text><view wx:if="{{repeatedReasons.length}}" class="repeat-list"><view wx:for="{{repeatedReasons}}" wx:key="reason" class="paper-tag green">{{item.reason}} × {{item.count}}</view></view><text wx:else class="body-text muted">当前区间还没有出现两次以上的同类问题。</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{highestEntry}}" class="ornament-card highest-card" bindtap="openHighestEntry"><text class="section-title">最高影响事件</text><text class="highest-summary">{{highestEntry.summaryPreview}}</text><view class="highest-meta"><text>{{highestEntry.displayDate}}</text><text>{{highestEntry.impactLevel}} 级 · {{highestEntry.primaryReason}}</text></view><text class="detail-hint">点开回看这条记录 →</text></view>
    <view class="ornament-card"><text class="section-title">问题分类分布</text><block wx:for="{{reasonDistribution}}" wx:key="reason"><view wx:if="{{item.count}}" class="reason-row"><view class="row between"><text>{{item.reason}}</text><text>{{item.count}} 次</text></view><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%;"></view></view></view></block></view>
  </block>
  <button class="sticker-button secondary" bindtap="goNewDiary">写一条日记</button>
</view>
